will classify each study as INCLUDE or EXCLUDE. The inclusion requires RCTs in adults with heart failure where the      
intervention is mHealth-delivered education via mobile/wireless technologies (e.g., apps, web-for-mobile, SMS, social   
media) versus usual HF care. I will exclude studies that are telemonitoring-only without educational content, non-RCTs, 
non-adult HF, in-person/paper/desktop-only, device-only, reviews, protocols without qualifying interventions, or        
provider-focused interventions. I will construct a decisions list preserving study_index and provide a brief rationale  
for each, ensuring all labels are set to exactly INCLUDE or EXCLUDE. Finally, I will return the corrected JSON in the   
required schema wrapped within the requested final answer structure.                                                    
                                                                                                                        
