│ congestive heart failure in high risk patients", "abstract": "BackgroundCongestive heart failure remains a major     │
│ reason for readmissions for certain high risk patients. Some of these readmissions can be lowered with aggressive    │
│ follow up and close monitoring of certain high risk patients. Unfortunately, given limited resources it is often     │
│ challenging to provide the attention and follow-up needed to tackle this challenge.MethodsWe selected patients with  │
